# DriveNets Topology Studio - Cursor Rules (LEAN)
# Unified subtree monorepo: topology/ (canvas editor + servers) + scaler/ (DNOS scaler lib).

## Always-on doctrine (the rest is on-demand)

- NO EMOJIS anywhere in this codebase. Use SVG icons (defined in
  `topology/index.html`) or text prefixes (`[OK]`, `[WARN]`, `[ERROR]`, `[INFO]`).
- MULTI-USER BY DEFAULT. Every new feature/endpoint/state file is per-user under
  `~/.topology_users/<username>/` via `user_store.user_data_path(...)`. Mutating
  `/api/` routes need JWT auth + role check. No new global JSON/SQLite/dict.

## Quick key paths

| What | Path |
|------|------|
| Repo root | `/home/dn/drivenets-topology-studio/` |
| Topology app | `topology/` |
| Main orchestrator | `topology/topology.js` (~13K lines) |
| Dev guidelines | `topology/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDELINES.md` |
| Scaler library | `scaler/scaler/` |

## Before editing

1. Always read `topology/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDELINES.md`.
2. For repo structure, full key-paths table, running the app, and subtree sync:
   read `.cursor/rules/repo-operations.mdc`.
3. For session context, run `/XDN`; skill `~/.cursor/skills/xdn-topology-mastery/`.
4. Routing of all other rules is handled by `~/.cursor/rules/rules-router.mdc`.
